name: fading
row: S1 FU400 FD400,S2 F200
# A fade moves 255 / (duration / 30 ms) per step. The 30 ms steps of the two engines do not line up with the sample
# times, so a sample in the middle of a fade can be one step apart. Allow one step of the 200 ms fade (43).
tolerance: 45
S 1 1
S 2 1
wait 100
wait 100
wait 100
wait 300
S 1 0
S 2 0
wait 100
wait 100
wait 400
